From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aneesh Bhave <aneesh1701@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add hide-from-own-capture layer rule

A layer surface matching it is left out of screen captures made by its
own client, over both wlr-screencopy and ext-image-copy-capture. Captures
made by anyone else still show it.

This lets an overlay draw from a live capture of the screen under it,
like a magnifier, without seeing itself in that capture.
